se divers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on commercial contracts from major energy and mining corporations. Study each contract carefully — the pay, the weather report, and the environmental conditions (expected current strength and visibility) — since these directly determine how hard the job ahead will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/b03e68acdf40cbcb23c6dc34edaf6470.avif?t=1785836798\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras_big/b03e68acdf40cbcb23c6dc34edaf6470.avif?t=1785836798 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then descend in the diving bell to the ocean floor, check your mission brief, and gear up before stepping out into the black void of the deep ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/a0f321951771a4b4decb7ef14c9b0a2f.poster.avif?t=1785836798\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/a0f321951771a4b4decb7ef14c9b0a2f.webm?t=1785836798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/a0f321951771a4b4decb7ef14c9b0a2f.mp4?t=1785836798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/8db43f4e1d2b1b0eaf75e35ccd9de242.avif?t=1785836798\" data-big-src=h