?t=1785836798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/28b6ac835d7e4914cd9d957ecef4c04f.poster.avif?t=1785836798\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/28b6ac835d7e4914cd9d957ecef4c04f.webm?t=1785836798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/28b6ac835d7e4914cd9d957ecef4c04f.mp4?t=1785836798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout, keep an eye on your umbilical — a snag can cut off your gas, warmth, or power in an instant — and monitor your life support on your wristwatch. Down here, the margin for error is incredibly small, and a single mistake can very quickly turn fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/7c5b428e5e98be7bb14f12c12f789d95.avif?t=1785836798\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras_big/7c5b428e5e98be7bb14f12c12f789d95.avif?t=1785836798 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/e66243b84c906c5240d5bcfd713f0c11.avif?t=1785836798\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras_big/e66243b84c906c5240d5bcfd713f0c11.avif?t=1785836798 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the job, welding a structural tear, inspecting a pipeline, repairing a valve, then return to the bell before something goes wrong. Success earns you the contract's payment, plus skill points that upgrade your saturation diving license.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/6ce14a4e74fb6950b49a8d9dcb6dc291.avif?t=1785836798\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras_big/6ce14a4e74fb6950b49a8d9dcb6dc291.avif?t=1785836798 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A higher-tier license unlocks contracts from bigger corporations, better pay, but greater depths, worse conditions, and lower visibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/bcc085662112bcec7f108b10859bb9b3.avif?t=1785836798\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras_big/bcc085662112bcec7f108b10859bb9b3.avif?t=1785836798 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/57ce4a63d04d441f5ea68058de4c32f0.avif?t=1785836798\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras_big/57ce4a63d04d441f5ea68058de4c32f0.avif?t=1785836798 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>But the deeper you go, the stranger it gets.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 95% of the ocean remains unexplored. What we have found down there is pure nightmare fuel: colossal and giant squids with eyes the size of dinner plates, anglerfish luring prey with their own glowing lure, goblin sharks with jaws that snap forward to seize their catch, bristle worms that lie in wait to slice their prey in half. And zombie worms, that survive by devouring the bones of the dead from below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/2ea0ba1860bc75d96fde4434b647ba94.poster.avif?t=1785836798\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/2ea0ba1860bc75d96fde4434b647ba94.webm?t=1785836798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/extras/2ea0ba1860bc75d96fde4434b647ba94.mp4?t=1785836798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if this is what we've found in the 5% we've explored imagine what could be lurking in the other 95% of darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Live and work in complete darkness at the bottom of the ocean, in a simulation of one of the most extreme professions on the planet: saturation diving. But with only about 5% of the deep ocean explored, imagine what could be lurking down there with you in the dark?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/d962c6e93d03525f0082998c05be8e17339ebb6d/header.jpg?t=1785836798", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/040fc1392f9141c494e6be0cc0656c2acf56f860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785836798", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/040fc1392f9141c494e6be0cc0656c2acf56f860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785836798", "website": "https://projectintothevoid.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6 GB / AMD RX 580 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> N/A</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS: Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400 / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 / AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Fire Chariot Studios"], "publishers": ["Fire Chariot Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943800/474396a9a1257c82a8913d030a10a72edb8c45b8/ss_474396a9a1257c82a8913d030a10a72edb8c45b8.600x338.jpg?t=1785836798", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto