cohol abuse, self-harm, or any of the sensitive themes listed in Valve's example categories (sexual assault, BDSM, etc.), none of these are present in the game."}, "ratings": {"dejus": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "14", "required_age": "14", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Violência\nMedo"}, "steam_germany": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "16", "required_age": "16", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Horror"}, "igrs": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "18", "required_age": "18", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Horor\nKekerasan\nInteraksi Daring"}}}}}